Title: Judge's Crossword Puzzle No. 61
Author: Gardner Rea
Date: 1926-02-06
Byline: Submitted by Gardner Rea, Brookhaven, N. Y. Judge pays $25 for each puzzle printed.
Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1926-02-06_90/page/n33/mode/1up
Number: 61
Solution-Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1926-02-13_90/page/n33/mode/1up


